  displayName: Skeleton
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2f6eba8a6421bb9448a8e9f3891ca7a3, type: 3}
  description: 'Skeletons are undead humanoid frames of medium size, stripped to
    bare bone. They move with stiff, jerky steps at a normal walking pace, bones
    clattering and armor rattling but seldom rushing. They are unnervingly silent
    in voice: no breathing, no speech - only the dry scrape of bones and weapons.'
